e handled. No substantive gap, repair or narrowing found. This is internal AI-assisted review, not external human refereeing or a historical-priority certificate. Public article is pending; canonical remains blank. Evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/65256bfa6661c2965226bfaa1ca65ce6c551904f/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-clearance-23334001-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nComplete 5-page manuscript and 367-line controlling TeX acquired with unchanged checksum-verified native files. Native record created 13 October 2026 at 06:36:40 UTC; declared publication date is recorded separately. Independent source-first scope and adversarial reviews are frozen; root's own source-first validation is pending. No scientific disposition or public page approved; canonical remains blank. Source evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/438ac3f6cca7a927c51c77d2c8d939480c1c2df0/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/source153-155-sol-20261116/SOURCE_PACKET_FINAL.json"},{"key":"1052646184:154:26","row":155,"col":26,"value":"https://aleckriebel.com/research/outer-focal-inversion-area-product/"},{"key":"1052646184:154:27","row":155,"col":27,"value":"Published"},{"key":"1052646184:154:29","row":155,"col":29,"value":"16 November 2026 publication: Full original manuscript review passed; the reviewed article is now published at https://aleckriebel.com/research/outer-focal-inversion-area-product/. Original abstract, scope, prior credit, AI/unrefereed status, native files and rights are preserved. Live desktop and 390px mobile embedded PDFs, original-PDF opening and PDF/ZIP/BibTeX downloads were checked; all downloaded bytes match the originals. Article, research index and sitemap are live. No corresponding article was found in the bounded 47-page current GitHub Pages inventory; no redirect was needed. Website commit: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/aleckriebel.com/commit/ff36a8299805d9a6196a3d5b081d354c87627056 . Earlier scientific evidence is retained below. Publication verification is recorded in research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-odd-areas-boolean-city-live-20261116/FINAL_LIVE_RECEIPT.json.\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nFull original Zenodo version 1.0 passed substantive root review plus independent scope and adversarial reviews. The product concerns signed straight-edge areas after unit inversion of outer tangent vertices about the original billiard foci, for all admitted least odd periods and stars; the critical triangular case, positivity and scaling clauses are covered. No substantive gap, repair or narrowing found. Original-vertex and outer-locus-focus constructions remain distinct. Internal AI-assisted review is not external human refereeing or a priority certificate. Public article is pending; canonical remains blank. Evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/65256bfa6661c2965226bfaa1ca65ce6c551904f/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-clearance-23394004-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nComplete 6-page manuscript and 229-line controlling TeX acquired with unchanged checksum-verified native files. Native record created 15 October 2026 at 11:39:15 UTC; declared publication date is recorded separately. Independent source-first scope and adversarial reviews are frozen; root's own source-first validation is pending. No scientific disposition or public page approved; canonical remains blank. Source evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/438ac3f6cca7a927c51c77d2c8d939480c1c2df0/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/source153-155-sol-20261116/SOURCE_PACKET_FINAL.json"},{"key":"1052646184:158:26","row":159,"col":26,"value":"https://aleckriebel.com/research/boolean-cube-polynomial-compatibility/"},{"key":"1052646184:158:27","row":159,"col":27,"value":"Published"},{"key":"1052646184:158:29","row":159,"col":29,"value":"16 November 2026 publication: Full original manuscript review passed; the reviewed article is now published at https://aleckriebel.com/research/boolean-cube-polynomial-compatibility/. Original abstract, scope, prior credit, AI/unrefereed status, native files and rights are preserved. Live desktop and 390px mobile embedded PDFs, original-PDF opening and PDF/ZIP/BibTeX downloads were checked; all downloaded bytes match the originals. Article, research index and sitemap are live. No corresponding article was found in the bounded 47-page current GitHub Pages inventory; no redirect was needed. Website commit: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/aleckriebel.com/commit/ff36a8299805d9a6196a3d5b081d354c87627056 . Earlier scientific evidence is retained below. Publication verification is recorded in research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-odd-areas-boolean-city-live-20261116/FINAL_LIVE_RECEIPT.json.\n\nEarlier inventory note:\n16 November 2026 update: Full original uniform-Boolean-cube theorem passed manuscript, independent and adversarial review. For nonzero real multilinear degree-at-most-d polynomials, pointwise disjoint supports force a coordinate relative influence >=1/(1024d^8); every influence <=1/(4096d^8) guarantees a common nonzero vertex. Normalization includes the constant coefficient. The credited Li–Li–Li–Liu separator, real OSSS covariance and classical Markov inputs are prior work; the contribution is their explicit target-specific deduction. Root's informed review discloses pre-INITIAL scope-outline exposure; the two scientific families were independent. One unchanged finite native diagnostic corroborated the proof. No repair, narrowing, firstness, broader-measure claim or qualifying follow-up. Page preparing; canonical blank until live verification. Evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/9d9c389718f51d9f2dd8abf603c84169cdabb9ea/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-clearance-23443301-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nComplete four-page native manuscript and 288-line controlling TeX acquired with checksum-bound original files. Native creation: 17 October 2026 at 23:12:45 UTC. Independent scope and adversarial review packets are frozen. Root has read the full manuscript and frozen an informed reconstruction, with prior scope-outline exposure disclosed; final comparison remains pending. No scientific disposition or public page approved; canonical remains blank. Source evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/65256bfa6661c2965226bfaa1ca65ce6c551904f/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-source156-adoption-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nPublished paper record with checksum-bound manuscript; deep review still required."},{"key":"1052646184:159:26","row":160,"col":26,"value":"https://aleckriebel.com/research/fixed-city-quantitative-persistence/"},{"key":"1052646184:159:27","row":160,"col":27,"value":"Published"},{"key":"1052646184:159:29","row":160,"col":29,"value":"16 November 2026 publication: Full original manuscript review passed; the reviewed article is now published at https://aleckriebel.com/research/fixed-city-quantitative-persistence/. Original abstract, scope, prior credit, AI/unrefereed status, native files and rights are preserved. Live desktop and 390px mobile embedded PDFs, original-PDF opening and PDF/ZIP/BibTeX downloads were checked; all downloaded bytes match the originals. Article, research index and sitemap are live. No corresponding article was found in the bounded 47-page current GitHub Pages inventory; no redirect was needed. Website commit: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/aleckriebel.com/commit/ff36a8299805d9a6196a3d5b081d354c87627056 . Earlier scientific evidence is retained below. Publication verification is recorded in research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-odd-areas-boolean-city-live-20261116/FINAL_LIVE_RECEIPT.json.\n\nEarlier inventory note:\n16 November 2026 update: Full original fixed-city theorem passed source-first, independent and adversarial review. The exact normalized hard-area ODE has unique global positive classical trajectories; beta>2alpha gives the stated explicit all-site/all-positive-initial persistence bound. The asymmetric three-city example stays between1/4096 and2047/2048. The literal unrestricted2007alpha>1 collapse alternative fails; the later stochastic founding model and convergence are outside scope. Aldous's protected-neighborhood mechanism and Ferudun's directly overlapping qualitative two-city inference receive prior credit; no firstness is claimed. One ordinary original exact-arithmetic diagnostic passed; all229 source files and30directories stayed unchanged. Native1.0.0 is actually printed. No repair, narrowing or qualifying follow-up. Page preparing; canonical blank until live verification. Evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/9d9c389718f51d9f2dd8abf603c84169cdabb9ea/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-clearance-23393139-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nComplete five-page native manuscript and 192-line controlling TeX acquired with checksum-bound original files. Native creation: 15 October 2026 at 11:02:16 UTC. Independent source-first scope and adversarial INITIALs are frozen; full reviews and root examination remain pending. No scientific disposition or public page approved; canonical remains blank. Source evidence: https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/65256bfa6661c2965226bfaa1ca65ce6c551904f/research_website_catalogue_20261024/verification/root-source156-adoption-20261116.json\n\nEarlier inventory note:\nPublished paper record with checksum-bound manuscript; deep review still required."}]}